    "text": "<p>Distance is stated as&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>[</mo><mi>L</mi><mo>]</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfenced><mrow><mo>[</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>]</mo></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfenced></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mfenced close=\"\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mi>n</mi><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mfenced><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mfrac><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mfrac><mfrac><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfenced></mfrac></math></p><p>Or, we have&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfenced></math></p><p>Similarly, time&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mi>T</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mi>v</mi></mfenced><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mi>a</mi></mfenced></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfenced><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfenced></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mi>n</mi><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mstyle><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mfenced></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>m</mi></mfrac><mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfenced><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfenced></mfrac></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>m</mi></mfrac><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math></p>",
